( https://albiononline.com/update/into-the-fray )

Adventurer,

*Into the Fray* is here! This update brings a host of new features includin=
g reworked Magic Staffs, new Portal Towns, improved Castles, Dynamic Events=
, new Arena and Crystal League modes, and much more.

To celebrate the launch of this major update, we've created a brand-new tra=
iler:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DKLKfDuuL8iM )

Get Into the Action
-------------------

*Magic Staffs* have new visuals and animations alongside reworked abilities=
. *Castles and Outposts* have been overhauled with new graphics, layouts, a=
nd mechanics to make these high-end objectives more thrilling than ever. An=
d the *Crystal Arena* and *Non-Lethal Crystal League* offer competitive but=
 accessible 5v5s for players of all levels.

( https://albiononline.com/update/into-the-fray )

Albion at Your Fingertips
-------------------------

New *Portal Towns* in the Outlands offer Bank and Marketplace access along =
with visually reworked *Invisibility Shrines*. *Resources* have received a =
graphical overhaul, standing out within their environments and making gathe=
ring easier and more enticing. New *Daily Events* offer bonuses for a wide =
range of activities, encouraging players to try new parts of the game and s=
haking up Albion=E2=80=99s economy.

( https://albiononline.com/update/into-the-fray )

Additional Improvements
-----------------------

A new *Activities UI* provides a convenient overview of all ongoing events.=
 *Twitch Drops* are available for the first time, and *Victory Emotes* let =
players mark kills with audiovisual flourishes. *Lost Equipment Loadouts* a=
llow easy regearing after death, a new *Journey Back* ability helps cut dow=
n on long travel times, *Gathering Tomes* offer faster gathering progress, =
and *Training Dummies* allow players to practice combat and healing abiliti=
es on their Islands.

( https://albiononline.com/update/into-the-fray )

For the complete list of changes, check out the official patchnotes ( https=
://albiononline.com/changelog/into-the-fray-update ) , and for more info, s=
ee the official update page:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/update/into-the-fray )

